    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.32,
      "text": "highlights the real-world risks of unpredictability."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.8,
      "end": 5.34,
      "text": "People use pattern building to generate scams that scale,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.82,
      "end": 8.8,
      "text": "creating fake identities and convincing messages in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.5,
      "end": 11.1,
      "text": "There is also the issue of deep fakes."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.82,
      "end": 15.7,
      "text": "The system can use its patterns to create convincing fake media"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.7,
      "end": 18.62,
      "text": "that can be used to target or humiliate individuals."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.5,
      "end": 22.38,
      "text": "Even without malicious intent, AI can hallucinate."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.88,
      "end": 25.52,
      "text": "It can sound highly confident delivering medical or"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.52,
      "end": 27.12,
      "text": "safety answers that are flat wrong."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.64,
      "end": 29.72,
      "text": "The industry tries to manage these risks."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.52,
      "end": 32.86,
      "text": "During training, they teach AI to avoid harmful behavior."
    }
  ],
